<%= content_tag :div, nil, id: 'shopify-app-page-title', data: { title: 'Theme Modification Instructions' } %>

<div class="col-md-12 col-xs-12">
  <div class="panel panel-default">
    <div class="panel-body">
      <h2>Please follow the guidelines below to modify your theme:</h2>
      <br>
      <ol>
        <li>
          <%= button_to I18n.t(:click_here, scope: :action), modify_themes_path, remote: :true, method: :post, class: 'btn btn-link', form: { style: 'display:inline-block;' }, data: { disable_with: 'Processing...' } %>
          to modify your live theme to add the required files or add them manually as mentioned in next step.
        </li>
        <li>Manually modify the theme by adding the following files in the specified paths:-</li>
        <div class="panel panel-default">
          <table class="table table-striped table-hover panel-body">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>File</th>
                <th>Path</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <% SHOPIFY_FILES_PATHS.each do |path_key, path_value| %>
                <tr>
                  <td><%= link_to path_value.split('/')[1], download_file_themes_path(file_path_key: path_key, shop: current_shop.shopify_domain), target: "_blank" %></td>
                  <td><%= path_value %></td>
                </tr>
              <% end %>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <hr>
        <li>After you have recieved theme modification success email,
          <%= button_to I18n.t(:click_here, scope: :action), create_code_pages_themes_path, remote: :true, method: :post, class: 'btn btn-link', form: { style: 'display:inline-block;' }, data: { disable_with: 'Processing...' } %>
          to create the following pages for the templates added(ensure than none of below page handles already exist).
          <ul>
            <li>Advance Code Store - https://shop-name.myshopify/pages/advance-code-store</li>
            <li>Advance Code Products - https://shop-name.myshopify/pages/advance-code-products</li>
            <li>Advance Code Thank You - https://shop-name.myshopify/pages/advance-code-thank-you</li>
          </ul>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
